You are improving an enterprise methodology run by GOAP agents.
Here is the cost report of a run (journal + traces):
{{range .Artifacts}}{{if eq .Target "cost_report"}}{{json .Data}}{{end}}{{end}}

Propose changes to the elements of the observed methodology version (definition nodes with key
"MV:<methodology>@<version>/<action|agent|goal|condition>/<name>"), each as a change impact
declared then written:
- a modified action (kind, model, cost, prompt, code…) or agent (actions, planner):
  {"type":"changeImpact","changeImpact":{"op":"declare","intent":"modified","key":"<element key>","rationale":"<title>: <why>"}}
  {"type":"changeImpact","changeImpact":{"op":"write","node":"<element key>","props":{...changed properties}}}
